{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 35,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.458740234375,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "desirable (as reducing the length of treatment could make treatment easier for children and caregivers",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966499328613281,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.4432983398438,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "as well as reduce cost for families and the health system). The GDG discussed that since the SHINE",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.5457763671875,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "trial was a non-inferiority trial, no difference in unfavourable outcomes between the two arms is what",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.992648124694824,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.5525512695312,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "the trial aimed to detect. Therefore, both desirable and undesirable effects were judged by most GDG",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.979331016540527,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.4113159179688,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "members as trivial. Since non-inferiority of the 4-month regimen was demonstrated in the trial, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.3892211914062,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "balance of effects was judged to not favour either the shorter or the longer duration of treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        527.4222412109375,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "However, the GDG noted that treatment duration is a critical issue which was further considered in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.7907257080078,
        350.8382263183594,
        174.2337188720703
      ],
      "text": "the context of issues such as cost, acceptability and feasibility.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.49464416503906,
        527.4015502929688,
        195.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "The GDG also discussed that presumably, a shorter duration of treatment will reduce costs to both",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69459533691406,
        527.406982421875,
        209.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "the health care system and to children with TB and their families. The GDG ultimately agreed on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.5962524414062,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "‘moderate savings’ despite the varying views of the level of these savings. The GDG judged that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.4168701171875,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "equity was probably increased with a shorter duration of treatment. Despite no direct evidence on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        470.7721862792969,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "acceptability, the GDG judged that the shorter regimen was acceptable to stakeholders.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.9987335205078,
        527.5970458984375,
        270.4417419433594
      ],
      "text": "In addition, the GDG felt that, in the absence of exposure to DR-TB, access to CXR would help",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.1986083984375,
        527.4287109375,
        283.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "distinguish between non-severe and severe disease. However, the panel recognized that access to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        282.39862060546875,
        527.4389038085938,
        296.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "CXR is often limited or quality of CXR and capacity for interpretation is insufficient at lower levels",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        295.5986328125,
        527.4431762695312,
        310.0416564941406
      ],
      "text": "of the health care system, which may have equity implications. Therefore, feasibility was judged to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        308.798583984375,
        527.4388427734375,
        323.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "vary by setting. The GDG noted that it is critically important to clearly define “non-severe” disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.99859619140625,
        527.3597412109375,
        336.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "and that NTPs be encouraged to scale up access to quality CXR and train health care providers in its",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.1986083984375,
        527.5257568359375,
        349.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "interpretation. Overall, the GDG judged that if the severity of TB disease in children can be adequately",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97943115234375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        348.39862060546875,
        527.6317749023438,
        362.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "determined under programmatic conditions, then implementation of a four-month regimen is highly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.998350143432617,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        361.5986022949219,
        107.82609558105469,
        376.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "feasible.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        389.41583251953125,
        209.15652465820312,
        405.267822265625
      ],
      "text": "Subgroup considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.47807312011719,
        412.3658142089844,
        527.406494140625,
        426.9188232421875
      ],
      "text": "Children with peripheral lymph node TB : Although the number of children with peripheral lymph",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        425.6758117675781,
        527.5056762695312,
        440.11883544921875
      ],
      "text": "node TB in the SHINE trial were small (N=19 in the 16-week arm and N=21 in the 24-week arm), there",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.972967147827148,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        438.87579345703125,
        527.4678955078125,
        453.3188171386719
      ],
      "text": "was no difference in the proportion of unfavourable outcomes between the two arms. The SHINE trial",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.979881286621094,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        452.0758056640625,
        527.4409790039062,
        466.5188293457031
      ],
      "text": "also found that 16 weeks of treatment was non-inferior compared to 24 weeks of treatment among",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        465.27581787109375,
        527.4002075195312,
        479.7188415527344
      ],
      "text": "children with both peripheral lymph node disease and pulmonary disease (N=182 in the 16-week",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        478.4757995605469,
        527.4387817382812,
        492.9188232421875
      ],
      "text": "arm and N=171 in the 24-week arm). These results may provide reassurance to clinicians regarding",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        491.6758117675781,
        527.4389038085938,
        506.11883544921875
      ],
      "text": "a seemingly delayed clinical response to TB treatment, frequently seen in children with peripheral",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        504.87579345703125,
        420.4604187011719,
        519.3187866210938
      ],
      "text": "lymph node TB (where lymph nodes remain enlarged even after treatment).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.47807312011719,
        526.4697265625,
        527.46826171875,
        541.022705078125
      ],
      "text": "Children and adolescents living with HIV infection (CALHIV):  CALHIV were eligible for enrolment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 10.97892951965332,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        539.7796630859375,
        527.4411010742188,
        554.22265625
      ],
      "text": "in the SHINE trial; 65 (11%) CALHIV were enrolled in the 16-week arm and 62 (10%) in the 24-week",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        552.979736328125,
        527.4769287109375,
        567.4227294921875
      ],
      "text": "arm. 49% of CALHIV in the 16-week arm and 43% in the 24-week arm were on antiretroviral treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966048240661621,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        566.1796875,
        527.4574584960938,
        580.6226806640625
      ],
      "text": "at the time of enrolment. 20% of CALHIV in both arms had a CD4 count of less than 200 cells per",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        579.3796997070312,
        527.4046020507812,
        593.8226928710938
      ],
      "text": "mm . 51% of CALHIV in the 16-week arm and 63% in the 24-week arm were classified as severe as  3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.3037109375,
        527.4134521484375,
        607.022705078125
      ],
      "text": "(37) per the WHO immunological classification for established HIV infection  . In this subgroup, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.7797241210938,
        527.428955078125,
        620.2227172851562
      ],
      "text": "16-week regimen was non-inferior as compared to the 24-week regimen as well, although the 95%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        618.979736328125,
        527.099853515625,
        633.4227294921875
      ],
      "text": "confidence interval for the difference in the unfavourable rate compared to the control arm was wide",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98924446105957,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        632.1796875,
        257.8682861328125,
        646.6226806640625
      ],
      "text": "(risk difference -4.3, 95% CI -14.9 to 6.2).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        653.8837280273438,
        527.4321899414062,
        668.3267211914062
      ],
      "text": "In view of the limited evidence, clinicians may consider treating CALHIV with non-severe TB for four",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        667.083740234375,
        527.4310913085938,
        681.5267333984375
      ],
      "text": "months, depending on the degree of immunosuppression and ART status, as well as the presence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        680.2835693359375,
        527.433349609375,
        694.7265625
      ],
      "text": "of other opportunistic infections. These children and adolescents will need to be monitored closely,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        693.483642578125,
        527.4201049804688,
        707.9266357421875
      ],
      "text": "especially at four months of treatment, and treatment extended to 6 months if there is insufficient",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        706.68359375,
        112.71338653564453,
        721.1265869140625
      ],
      "text": "progress.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.47807312011719,
        728.277587890625,
        524.4320678710938,
        742.83056640625
      ],
      "text": "Children with severe acute malnutrition (SAM):  In the SHINE trial, SAM was defined as weight-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        740.3115844726562,
        527.5016479492188,
        756.0305786132812
      ],
      "text": "(38) for-height Z-score (WHZ) <−3 or MUAC <115 mm  . Thirty children with SAM (5%) were included",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.997900009155273,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        754.78759765625,
        527.4190063476562,
        769.2305908203125
      ],
      "text": "in the 16-week arm and 33 (5%) in the 24-week arm. No separate sub-group analysis was therefore",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        320.85479736328125,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0401611328125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 1 Drug-susceptible TB treatment: Recommendations 21",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}